==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|за-|дать}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|зада́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-задать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|зада́ть|pf|impf=задава́ть}}

# to [[set]], to [[assign]] (an exercise or lesson)
#: {{ux|ru|[[мы|Нам]] '''за́дали''' [[три]] [[упражнение|упражне́ния]] [[по]] [[алгебра|а́лгебре]].|t=We were given (assigned) three exercises in algebra (as homework).}}
# to [[ask]] (a question)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''зада́ть''' [[вопро́с]]/[[вопрос|вопро́сы]]|t=to ask a question/questions}}
# to [[pose]] (a problem)
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[give]], to [[throw]] (a [[dinner]] or [[banquet]])
# to [[give]], to [[administer]] (a [[punishment]])
#: {{uxi|ru|'''зада́ть''' [[трёпка|трёпку]]|t=to give a thrashing, to give a dressing-down}}
# to [[preset]], to [[specify]], to [[assign]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|irreg/c(1),c+p|зада́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|зада́ние}}
* {{l|ru|зада́ча}}
